r-thread-0) Unhandled exception: java.lang.ClassCastException: class io.vertx.core.impl.FutureImpl cannot be cast to class java.lang.Throwable (io.vertx.core.impl.FutureImpl is in unnamed module of loader 'app'; java.lang.Throwable is in module java.base of loader 'bootstrap')\r\n\tat io.hyperfoil.tools.horreum.api.NotificationService_VertxInvoker_onNewChange_a9f47974e2839427df5a82b571e8a38214a4cbad$$function$$1.handle(NotificationService_VertxInvoker_onNewChange_a9f47974e2839427df5a82b571e8a38214a4cbad$$function$$1.zig:63)\r\n\tat io.vertx.core.impl.ContextImpl.lambda$executeBlocking$2(ContextImpl.java:313)\r\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor.runWorker(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:1128)\r\n\tat java.base/java.util.concurrent.ThreadPoolExecutor$Worker.run(ThreadPoolExecutor.java:628)\r\n\tat io.netty.util.concurrent.FastThreadLocalRunnable.run(FastThreadLocalRunnable.java:30)\r\n\tat java.base/java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:834)\r\n```\r\nand the actual exception that is probably the exception result of the `FutureImpl` is swallowed while the problem above fires.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe original exception is logged.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nIt's rather hard to isolate what triggered it. Just fix the bytecode in .zig and we'll see.\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `java -version`: openjdk version \"11.0.5\" 2019-10-15 (FROM fabric8/java-alpine-openjdk11-jre)\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.7.0 but I was seeing this since ever\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`):  maven-3.6.2\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jaikiran","id":143523,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzUyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143523?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran","html_url":"https://github.com/jaikiran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaikiran/fol